pohoda-digest (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * Analytics and reporting tool for Money S3/Pohoda
  * Integration with mServer for data access
  * Modular analytics system with multiple report types
  * Command-line interface for automation
  * HTML reports with Bootstrap and Email themes
  * Outcoming invoices and debtor analysis modules
  * Cron-ready for scheduled reporting

